ath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "What does she fear about too much medicine\nA it results in difficulty to recuperate\nB it is detrimental to overall health\nC allocation must be based on need", "sourcePage": 256, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "What is the fundamental aspect of overdiagnosis?\nA identifying areas of benefit from treatment\nB trying to balance the effects of both\nC locating the harm of too much medicine", "sourcePage": 256, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Which perspective must be taken into account?\nA Primarily from the patient\nB chiefly based on a consensus\nC of the clinicians treating it", "sourcePage": 256, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "How must the issue be addressed?\nA by covering all basic social needs\nB by recognising the motives behind it\nC by identifying inherent social factors", "sourcePage": 257, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "The narrow sense meant by the speaker is\nA having a set of special parameters\nB rethinking the diagnostic categories\nC bordering the definitive boundaries\nNow look at extract two.\n\nExtract 2: Questions 37 to 42\nYou hear an interview with Tom Clarke, a science expert on break through in breast cancer\nresearch\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 257, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "What does Mr Clarke say about the new technology\nA they are beneficial for personalised care of patients\nB they are tailored to the requirements of the patient\nC it redefines the spectrum of identifying varying diseases", "sourcePage": 258, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "What does the study prove, according ot the speaker?\nA treatment course for a specific condition can be mentioned\nB large studies are plausible for respective conditions\nC breast cancer falls broadly into ten main genetic groups", "sourcePage": 258, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "What is the speaker’s view on breast cancer tumor types?\nA present understanding of treatment is flawed\nB certain conditions have positive outcomes\nC it can ensure appropriate treatment", "sourcePage": 258, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "Why does the speaker advocate a ‘more tailored approach’?\nA due to complexities in the treatment\nB because of the many facets of illness\nC since the condition is a sum total of disease", "sourcePage": 258, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "How do the advanced tests the doctors?\nA increase the tools for diagnosis\nB prevent the development of conditions\nC ascertain the treatment type required", "sourcePage": 259, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 261, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5